 interbank loans collateralised by government bonds (overnight federal funds) registered and traded at the SELIC (Sistema Especial de Liquida\u00e7\u00e3o e Cust\u00f3dia - Special System for Settlement and Custody).", "TITLE": " Central bank policy rates - Brazil - Monthly - End of period"}}'::jsonb),
